          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वाञ्छति — vāñchati — \"yearns for\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "यदि सः सुखं वाञ्छति, तर्हि सः परिश्रमं करोतु। yadi saḥ sukhaṃ vāñchati, tarhi saḥ pariśramaṃ karotu. If he wants happiness, let him work hard."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): सः सुखं वाञ्छितवान्, saḥ sukhaṃ vāñchitavān."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वाञ्छति (vāñchati) comes from the root √vāñch, \"to desire, to wish\"; MW compares German wünschen and English wish (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
